53515503635)", "source": "mediawiki-metadata"}, "CommonsMetadataExtension": {"value": 1.2, "source": "extension", "hidden": ""}, "Categories": {"value": "Flickr images reviewed by FlickreviewR 2|Photographs by Colin Cooke", "source": "commons-categories", "hidden": ""}, "Assessments": {"value": "", "source": "commons-categories", "hidden": ""}, "ImageDescription": {"value": "<p>This delightful small aviation museum exists in the old terminal building and surrounds at Malaga Airport. Not a many actual aircraft but these two propliners are in good condition despite not wearing original paint schemes.\n</p><p>Delivered to the USAAF as 45-1091 in 1945. Registered as N86442 then to the Spanish Air Force as T.3-50 in 1962. To Aerotransporte de España as EC-CPO in 1978. Stored at Zaragoza by 1992. Moved to Malaga in 2003 and preserved at the Museum as EC-ABC.\n</p>\nThe original EC-ABC belong to Iberia, but crashed on Wednesday 29 April 1959. The DC-3 departed Barcelona at 14:18 GMT for a flight to Madrid. A severe storm over Calamocha forced the crew to fly another course. Shortly after having been in contact with Calamocha, the plane crashed on the east slope of the Sierra de Valdemeca, some 60 m from the top of Telegraph Hill.", "source": "commons-desc-page"}, "DateTimeOriginal": {"value": "2024-02-07 17:48", "source": "commons-desc-page"}, "Credit": {"value": "<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.flickr.com/photos/cooke1/53515503635/\">EC-CPO Douglas C-47B Skytrain Museo Aeronáutico de Málaga 2.2.24</a>", "source": "commons-desc-page"}, "Artist": {"value": "<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.flickr.com/people/16172980@N07\">Colin Cooke Photo</a>", "source": "commons-desc-page"}, "LicenseShortName": {"value": "CC BY-SA 2.0", "source": "commons-desc-page", "hidden": ""}, "UsageTerms": {"value": "Creative Commons Attribution-Share Alike 2.0", "source": "commons-desc-page"}, "AttributionRequired": {"value": "true", "source": "commons-desc-page", "hidden": ""}, "LicenseUrl": {"value": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0", "source": "commons-desc-page"}, "Copyrighted": {"value": "True", "source": "commons-desc-page", "hidden": ""}, "Restrictions": {"value": "", "source": "commons-desc-page", "hidden": ""}, "License": {"value": "cc-by-sa-2.0", "source": "commons-templates", "hidden": ""}}, "mime": "image/jpeg"}}